      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-06",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Adoption Information Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires federally funded family planning programs to provide each person who inquires about medical or abortion&nbsp;services with specified information about adoption centers in their region. The Department of Health and Human Services must provide the programs with pamphlets containing the required information.</p>",
